[0.098, "o", "\r\u001b[5d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[7M\u001b[21d\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mShore\r\u001b[22d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[mKorhos is setting. Its outer halo burns with no warmth. Loud waves splash on the sand half a dozen\r\u001b[23d"]
[0.000, "o", "meters from your feet. The deep blue of the ocean steals a bit of the sky's orange glow.\r\u001b[25d"]
[0.000, "o", "The morning is brilliant.\r\u001b[27d"]
[0.000, "o", "You can see Uncle Oren here.\r\u001b[29d"]
[0.000, "o", ">"]
