[0.093, "o", "\r\u001b[5d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[9M\u001b[21d"]
[0.000, "o", "He used to be your mentor at the University Radiation Technology Division, during your first year of\u001b[22;1H"]
[0.000, "o", "assignment as a teacher and researcher. A man well in his seventies, he always looked sturdy and\r\u001b[23d"]
[0.000, "o", "healthy.\r\u001b[25d"]
[0.000, "o", "Lately, his retirement seems to have struck him quite a blow. His hair has gone completely white,\r\u001b[26d"]
[0.000, "o", "his posture slouched and his voice has got that sad croaking. He is staring at the horizon like a\r\u001b[27d"]
[0.000, "o", "bird in search of a migratory route.\r\u001b[29d>"]
[2.413, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mt\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.091, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1ma\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.090, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1ml\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
