[0.090, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m \u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.091, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mt\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.091, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mo\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.090, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m \u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.091, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mo\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.090, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mr\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.091, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1me\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.090, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mn\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.093, "o", "\r\u001b[5d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[12M\u001b[18d\"It is so beautiful, isn't it, Ektor?\" Uncle Oren says, pointing at the landscape. \"It looks like\r\u001b[19d"]
[0.000, "o", "Paradise.\"\r\u001b[21d"]
[0.000, "o", "\"It does,\" you reply.\r\u001b[23d"]
[0.000, "o", "Oren sends a glance to the west, towards Grey Cape, saying: \"I wonder what a man who was born here\r\u001b[24d"]
[0.000, "o", "-- I mean here, on Monarch -- would think, looking at this place. The sun, the sea going orange, the\u001b[25;1H"]
[0.000, "o", "endless sky.\"\r\u001b[27d"]
[0.000, "o", "A white electric arc paints the southern sky.\r\u001b[29d>"]
