[0.090, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m \u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.091, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mo\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.090, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mc\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.091, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1me\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.090, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1ma\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.091, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mn\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.094, "o", "\r\u001b[5d"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[4M\u001b[26dThe deep blue is infected by shades of orange, reflecting from the sky. Waves come and go,\r\u001b[27d"]
[0.000, "o", "peacefully.\r\u001b[29d>"]
[2.412, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mi\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
[0.091, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1mn\u001b(B\u001b[m"]
